  m_Name: Repair Request
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Repair Request
  content: "Repair Request\n\nEquipment:\nConveyor Line C-12\n\nIssue:\nRepeated
    grinding noise beneath the floor panels.\nInitial inspection found no damaged
    gears or loose fittings.\nNoise disappears whenever additional personnel arrive.\n\nRecommendation:\nSchedule
    a deeper inspection during shutdown.\n(Handwritten below.)\n\n\"Still hearing
    it. Probably just old pipes.\"\n\u2014 T.Q."
